recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the first seam now blocks the fleet rather than just me: REDS stands at exactly 40,960 of 40,960, so no ship can book a red until he raises it. Then whether fleet_call grows a path reader refusing a glob outside this root, and whether a proposal row's capability assumption should be gated on citing the guard that reads it
